@startuml

title Registration OTP Verification (with Retry)

actor User
participant Frontend
participant API
participant Keycloak
participant Twilio

User -> Frontend : Register Account
Frontend -> API : POST /register

API -> Keycloak : Create User\n(enabled=false)
Keycloak --> API : Created

API -> Twilio : Send OTP
Twilio --> API : OTP Sent

API --> Frontend : OTP Required

loop OTP Verification
    User -> Frontend : Enter OTP
    Frontend -> API : POST /verify-otp

    API -> Twilio : Validate OTP
    Twilio --> API : Result

    alt OTP Valid
        API -> Keycloak : Set enabled=true\nmobileVerified=true
        Keycloak --> API : Success
        API --> Frontend : Verification Successful
        break
    else OTP Invalid
        API --> Frontend : Invalid OTP
    else OTP Expired
        API --> Frontend : OTP Expired
        User -> Frontend : Resend OTP
        Frontend -> API : POST /resend-otp
        API -> Twilio : Send New OTP
        Twilio --> API : OTP Sent
    end
end

@enduml